# Public-header manifest -- ADR-015 "API stability policy".
#
# Every public header of the NimRTC API surface, one relative
# path per line, sorted, '/'-separated.  This file is the
# frozen baseline of the surface: `scripts/check_api_manifest.py`
# fails when the tree's header set drifts from it, so a header
# cannot be added, removed or renamed without the change being
# deliberate and reviewed.
#
# Regenerate with: python scripts/check_api_manifest.py --write
